name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q4_2025'

question 'A small business owner wants to redesign their website. They decide to start by planning three main sections: a homepage, a shop page, and a contact page. What design strategy are they used?'

wrong 'Debugging the website\'s broken code.'
wrong 'Pattern recognition, by repeating the same page layout.'
wrong 'Accessibility, by making the website easier to read.'
right 'Decomposition, by breaking the project into smaller, manageable parts.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

